            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.12+NUM.27.13+NUM.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 27:12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.48+DEU.32.49+DEU.32.50+DEU.32.51+DEU.32.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 32:48-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ayenyo Yehova i nindo maeca, awacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Rwoth Yehova, imaku nyutho dwong’ peri, ku cingi ma tek ni jatic peri: kum Mungu ma nedi m’i polo kadi m’i ng’om, ma copo timo calku tic peri, man calku tic peri ma teki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwei, wek akadh man anen ng’om ma ber maeno ma ni loka Yordan, got maeno ma ber, man Lebanon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kwinyo nego Yehova i kuma ni kumwu, e ewinja ngo; man Yehova wacu ira kumae, Eromo iri; kud iyer ira kendo pi lembe maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idh malu wi usimbru Pizga, man iting’ weng’i yo reto, ku yor ariwa ma malu, man yor ariwa ma piny, ku yo nyangu, man inen ku weng’i: kum ibikadhu loka Yordan maeni ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ing’ol ni Yocuwa, man idwok cwinye tek, imi ire tego de; kum ebikadhu i wang’ dhanu maeni, man ebiketho gigam ng’ombe ni aba m’ibineno. ",
          "type": "text",
